  "title": "BREAKING: MRI Confirms Grade 1 PCL Sprain for Gators WR Vernell Brown III",
  "excerpt": "An MRI confirmed a Grade 1 PCL sprain, the mildest grade, in Vernell Brown III’s knee, sources told GatorBait. He may not miss any games.",
  "featured": true,
